---
layout: layouts/dashboard.njk
title: Datatables Lanjutan
breadcrumb:
  - { label: "Home", url: "/" }
  - { label: "Tampilan Data", url: "/tables/basic/" }
  - { label: "Datatables Lanjutan" }
---
<div class="container-xl">
  <div class="page-header d-print-none">
    <div class="row align-items-center">
      <div class="col">
        <h2 class="page-title">Datatables Lanjutan</h2>
        <p class="text-muted small">Showcase tabel data interaktif dengan pencarian bersorot, filter baris dinamis, pagination, dan ekspor data ke CSV menggunakan Vanilla JS murni.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="page-body">
    <div class="card mb-4" data-at-datatable data-page-size="5" data-export-name="daftar_karyawan_admin">
      <div class="card-header d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-between gap-3 py-3">
        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-muted text-nowrap">Tampilkan</span>
          <select class="form-select form-select-sm at-table-pagesize" style="width: 75px;">
            <option value="5" selected>5</option>
            <option value="10">10</option>
            <option value="25">25</option>
            <option value="50">50</option>
          </select>
          <span class="text-muted text-nowrap">baris</span>
        </div>

        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 ms-auto">
          <div class="input-group input-group-sm" style="width: 250px;">
            <span class="input-group-text bg-light text-muted">{% icon "search", { class: "icon-sm" } %}</span>
            <input type="text" class="form-control at-table-search" placeholder="Cari data...">
          </div>
          <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm d-flex align-items-center gap-1 at-table-export-csv">
            {% icon "download", { class: "icon-sm" } %}
            <span>Ekspor CSV</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="table-responsive">
        <table class="table table-hover table-striped table-vcenter card-table text-nowrap align-middle m-0">
